    "speaker": "電機メーカー社長",
    "text": "ほう、それは素晴らしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "電機メーカー社長",
    "text": "では、黛くんと私、どちらが先に\r\nナンバーワンになれるか、競争だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082010270,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふふっ、負けませんよー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108201/4001082010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "電機メーカー社長",
    "text": "これは手強そうだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "電機メーカー社長",
    "text": "さて、芹沢くんと和泉くんにも\r\n挨拶をしたいのだが、彼女たちはどこに？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "se": "0220"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001082010280,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……！\r\nすぐに呼んできま──",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400108201/4001082010280"
  },
